    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packages are coming down the conveyor belt and you need to put them into the correct storage containers. One comes every 3.5 seconds. Place a package in the correct bin, a green light flashes and you're closer to filling it up (blue light). Once you've filled 18 of 30 containers, you've beat the level. Storing a package in the wrong location will yield a red light and a score penalty. If not removed, it will make your job much more difficult. Careful though because correct packages falling out of a full container will mark it as unfull, and constant collisions means you'll have to put more into that container. Try to get as high of a score as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah... and every package you miss gets vaporized and counts against your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score is calculated via this equation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >((Stow Rate - Incorrect Attempts)-(3 * Packages Destroyed)) / 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Stow Rate = (Packages Correctly Stowed / Seconds) * 3600   --- Since this is an hourly rate I get <br>pkgs/second and multiply by 3600 to get pkgs/hr</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any major issues please text my paging system at 7082064882</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packages are coming down the conveyor belt and you need to put them into the correct storage containers. One comes every 3.5 seconds. Place a package in the correct bin, a green light flashes and you're closer to filling it up (blue light). Once you've filled 18 of 30 containers, you've beat the level. Storing a package in the wrong location will yield a red light and a score penalty. If not removed, it will make your job much more difficult. Careful though because correct packages falling out of a full container will mark it as unfull, and constant collisions means you'll have to put more into that container. Try to get as high of a score as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah... and every package you miss gets vaporized and counts against your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score is calculated via this equation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >((Stow Rate - Incorrect Attempts)-(3 * Packages Destroyed)) / 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Stow Rate = (Packages Correctly Stowed / Seconds) * 3600   --- Since this is an hourly rate I get <br>pkgs/second and multiply by 3600 to get pkgs/hr</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any major issues please text my paging system at 7082064882</p>",
